{
    "title": "Solitaire Collection",
    "description": "Solitaire Collection is an all-in-one game of classic solitaire cards games. Solitaire Collection has Klondike solitaire card game, Spider solitaire card game, Pyramid solitaire card game, FreeCell solitaire card game, and Tripeaks solitaire card game inside. If you are like any one solitaire card game of these five ones, you can choose this solitaire collection; and if you love more than one kind of solitaire card games in it, this Solitaire Collection is really your best choice. All the solitaire card games in Solitaire Collection are classic ones. Play this solitaire card games every day to train your brain and relax your heart.\r\n\r\n<b>Klondike Solitaire</b>\r\nKlondike Solitaire is the most popular solitaire card games in the world, when people say solitaire they mean Klondike solitaire. And also Klondike solitaire is known as patience. Our Klondike solitaire is a old classic solitaire loved by many people. \r\n\r\n<b>Spider Solitaire</b>\r\nWe also have spider solitaire in this Solitaire Collection. These spider solitaire card games are easy and smooth, and each one has solutions, so it is a good choice to relax your heart.\r\n\r\n<b>Pyramid Solitaire</b>\r\nPyramid Solitaire just like its name, this solitaire card game will stack the cards into a pyramid. When you find tow cards which of the sum is 13, you can click to match them. Pyramid solitaire is very interesting; if you try it you will love it.\r\n\r\n<b>FreeCell Solitaire</b>\r\nSolitaire Collection also has FreeCell solitaire in it. FreeCell solitaire is played using the standard 52-card deck. Also FreeCell solitaire is estimated that 99.999% of deals are solvable, but we think FreeCell solitaire is the most difficult solitaire game in these 5 solitaire games. Many people love FreeCell solitaire because they love challenges and love logic to train their brain.\r\n\r\n<b>Tripeaks Solitaire</b>\r\nTripeaks Solitaire has many shapes waiting for you. You will love the Tripeaks Solitaire by its rich shapes and the smooth gameplay.\r\n\r\n<b>Beautiful Backgrounds</b>\r\nIn Solitaire Collection, there are hundreds of backgrounds. The backgrounds are beautiful and very clear; you can choose anyone you like to set as your background.\r\n\r\n<b>Design houses and gardens</b>\r\nYou can earn gems when playing solitaire card games, and use gems to design houses, gardens, and outdoors.\r\n\r\n<b>Pass Events</b>\r\nThere are pass events in this solitaire collection, such as sea adventure.\r\n\r\n<b>Daily Challenges</b>\r\nSolitaire Collection has daily challenges for each kind of solitaire card games, you can challenge yourself by playing these deals.\r\n\r\nOther features:\r\n-Unlimited Hints and Undos.\r\n-Play offline without network anytime.\r\n-Many card backs and card faces.\r\n-Many victory animations.\r\n-Daily tasks making the game more sense of purpose.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Solitaire Collection is an all-in-one game of classic solitaire cards games. Solitaire Collection has Klondike solitaire card game, Spider solitaire card game, Pyramid solitaire card game, FreeCell solitaire card game, and Tripeaks solitaire card game inside. If you are like any one solitaire card game of these five ones, you can choose this solitaire collection; and if you love more than one kind of solitaire card games in it, this Solitaire Collection is really your best choice. All the solitaire card games in Solitaire Collection are classic ones. Play this solitaire card games every day to train your brain and relax your heart.<br><br><b>Klondike Solitaire</b><br>Klondike Solitaire is the most popular solitaire card games in the world, when people say solitaire they mean Klondike solitaire. And also Klondike solitaire is known as patience. Our Klondike solitaire is a old classic solitaire loved by many people. <br><br><b>Spider Solitaire</b><br>We also have spider solitaire in this Solitaire Collection. These spider solitaire card games are easy and smooth, and each one has solutions, so it is a good choice to relax your heart.<br><br><b>Pyramid Solitaire</b><br>Pyramid Solitaire just like its name, this solitaire card game will stack the cards into a pyramid. When you find tow cards which of the sum is 13, you can click to match them. Pyramid solitaire is very interesting; if you try it you will love it.<br><br><b>FreeCell Solitaire</b><br>Solitaire Collection also has FreeCell solitaire in it. FreeCell solitaire is played using the standard 52-card deck. Also FreeCell solitaire is estimated that 99.999% of deals are solvable, but we think FreeCell solitaire is the most difficult solitaire game in these 5 solitaire games. Many people love FreeCell solitaire because they love challenges and love logic to train their brain.<br><br><b>Tripeaks Solitaire</b><br>Tripeaks Solitaire has many shapes waiting for you. You will love the Tripeaks Solitaire by its rich shapes and the smooth gameplay.<br><br><b>Beautiful Backgrounds</b><br>In Solitaire Collection, there are hundreds of backgrounds. The backgrounds are beautiful and very clear; you can choose anyone you like to set as your background.<br><br><b>Design houses and gardens</b><br>You can earn gems when playing solitaire card games, and use gems to design houses, gardens, and outdoors.<br><br><b>Pass Events</b><br>There are pass events in this solitaire collection, such as sea adventure.<br><br><b>Daily Challenges</b><br>Solitaire Collection has daily challenges for each kind of solitaire card games, you can challenge yourself by playing these deals.<br><br>Other features:<br>-Unlimited Hints and Undos.<br>-Play offline without network anytime.<br>-Many card backs and card faces.<br>-Many victory animations.<br>-Daily tasks making the game more sense of purpose.",
